string UISTR_WT_TIPAD1 "Download the colored logo of the 'Sphere' for your mobile phone, open the door to the magical world of the 'Sphere'. Without looking up from your business, wherever you are, you can get the logo of your favorite game and 15 days of playing time as a gift."
string UISTR_WT_TIPAD2 "Immerse yourself in the fabulous world of magic, heroic epic and fantastic legends by receiving the "Sphere" logo on your mobile phone."
string UISTR_WT_TIPAD3 "To get the logo, you need to send an SMS message with the word SPHERE to the number 8883. In the reply message you will receive a link to the logo and PIN code for 15 days of the game as a gift."
